percolator
------------------------------------------
Semi-supervised learning for peptide identification from shotgun proteomics
datasets

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libgomp1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/percolator/percolator

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/percolator/percolator/archive/rel-4-00-01.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack percolator-4.00.01-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./percolator-4.00.01-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/percolator-4.00.01-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/percolator-4.00.01-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(percolator)
  /usr/bin/percolator.exe
  /usr/bin/qvality.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/percolator.README
  /usr/share/doc/percolator/ReadMe.md
  /usr/share/doc/percolator/ReadMe.txt
  /usr/share/doc/percolator/license.txt

